Simple RC test (Tree)

V1 1 0 DC 0 SIN (0 1 1K 0 0)
R1 1 2 1
C1 2 0 1e-9

* Fan-out tree
X1 2 3 rctree_parallel

.subckt rc 1 2
R 1 2 1
C 2 0 1e-9
.ends

* Base building block (10 elements)
.subckt rc10 1 11
X1 1 2 rc
X2 2 3 rc
X3 3 4 rc
X4 4 5 rc
X5 5 6 rc
X6 6 7 rc
X7 7 8 rc
X8 8 9 rc
X9 9 10 rc
X10 10 11 rc
.ends

* 100 elements
.subckt rc100 1 11
X1 1 2 rc10
X2 2 3 rc10
X3 3 4 rc10
X4 4 5 rc10
X5 5 6 rc10
X6 6 7 rc10
X7 7 8 rc10
X8 8 9 rc10
X9 9 10 rc10
X10 10 11 rc10
.ends

* 1000 elements
